value.RAIN_STYLE.1=Realistic (rain and snow)
option.WATER_REFRACTION=Refraction (from above)
option.REFRACTION_STRENGTH=Refraction strength
option.SNELL_WINDOW=Snell's window (underwater)
option.SNELL_WINDOW.comment=Underwater, the outside is only visible within a ~48.6 degree cone; beyond it the surface mirrors the water (total internal reflection).
option.SKY_HAZE=Distance haze
option.SKY_HAZE.comment=How much far objects blend into the sky color behind them. 0 = only at the render edge.
